# What `docker build` (and so `kamal build`) may read of this folder.
#
# It is an allow-list: nothing enters the build but what the Dockerfile
# copies, the theme. So no secret file (.kamal/secrets), no .env file and no
# token can reach the build or an image layer, whatever lies in the folder.
# A file the Dockerfile is to COPY must be allowed here as well.
*
!theme/
